# WHITELIST. Everything is ignored unless listed below.
# The public repository holds only what the game needs to build and run, plus the licence and credit files the
# licences require (user decision 2026-10-24). Workflow files (agents/, docs/, scenarios/, the other tools/ scripts)
# stay on the developer's machine only and are never tracked. Never tracked either: the ISO, anything extracted or
# decompiled from it, caches, the OpenKH filename list (downloaded by `kh2 fetch-names` into local/), build output,
# screenshots, machine paths.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/Cargo.toml
!/Cargo.lock
!/README.md
!/CREDITS.md
!/LICENSE-MIT
!/LICENSE-APACHE
!/rust-toolchain.toml
!/crates/
!/sheets/
!/third_party/
!/tools/
/tools/*
!/tools/package.ps1
!/.cargo/

# Inside tracked folders: still never commit binaries or game-derived files.
*.iso
*.bin
*.img
*.idx
*.elf
*.png
*.dds
*.wav
*.exe
*.dll
target/
# Save states and recordings never enter tools/, agents/ or scenarios/.
*.p2s
*.p2m2
*.mp4
*.webp
*.jpg
__pycache__/
*.pyc
**/local/
# The Save menu's slot files (progress::save_dir; KH2_SAVE_DIR may name any folder, it is the user's own).
local/saves/
saves/
